# Dreadhorde Arcanist: "you may cast" -- the cast is optional. The Lightning Bolt Looting discarded is targeted on turn 3
# but Bot1 declines: it stays in the graveyard, not exiled, and Bot2 takes only combat damage. (The sibling
# dreadhorde-arcanist-casts-a-power-limited-spell-free-and-exiles-it is the positive control.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Dreadhorde Arcanist
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Llanowar Elves
Mountain
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dreadhorde Arcanist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Dreadhorde Arcanist)
! Bot1.Target(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Target(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt
Exile.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 19
